# The demo in the README. A dry run, so no sudo; needs pervetin on the PATH.
#   vhs docs/pervetin.tape
#   gifsicle -O3 --lossy=60 --colors 96 pervetin-raw.gif -o docs/pervetin.gif && rm pervetin-raw.gif
Output pervetin-raw.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1240
Set Height 570
Set Padding 16
Set Framerate 12
Env PERVETIN_DRY_RUN "1"
Env PERVETIN_QUIET "1"
Env PERVETIN_STAGE "wired"
Hide
Type "clear && pervetin" Enter
Show
Sleep 9s
Up
Sleep 1.8s
Up
Sleep 2.2s
Up
Sleep 1.3s
Up
Sleep 1.3s
Up
Sleep 1.6s
Up
Sleep 1.2s
Up
Sleep 3s
Right
Space
Sleep 5s
Left
Space
Sleep 7s
